 How AI is impacting global labor markets 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Global labor markets are proving resilient even as corporate AI adoption accelerates.


 While AI-related hiring headwinds are present, they are confined to a narrow set of industries and workers.


